
i) char:

Example Code

char ch = 'A';

System.out.println(Character.isLetter(ch));        // true
System.out.println(Character.isDigit(ch));         // false
System.out.println(Character.isUpperCase(ch));     // true
System.out.println(Character.isLowerCase(ch));     // false
System.out.println(Character.toLowerCase(ch));     // a
System.out.println(Character.toUpperCase('b'));    // B


----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Operation            | Syntax                          | Example                              | Output |
|:--------------------:|:-------------------------------:|:------------------------------------:|:------:|
| Check letter         | Character.isLetter(ch)          | Character.isLetter('A');             | true   |
| Check digit          | Character.isDigit(ch)           | Character.isDigit('5');              | true   |
| Check uppercase      | Character.isUpperCase(ch)       | Character.isUpperCase('A');          | true   |
| Check lowercase      | Character.isLowerCase(ch)       | Character.isLowerCase('a');          | true   |
| Convert to lowercase | Character.toLowerCase(ch)       | Character.toLowerCase('A');          | a      |
| Convert to uppercase | Character.toUpperCase(ch)       | Character.toUpperCase('b');          | B      |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

