iii) StringBuilder:

Example Code

StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder("Hello");

System.out.println(sb.length());            // 5
System.out.println(sb.charAt(1));           // e
System.out.println(sb.append("World"));     // HelloWorld
System.out.println(sb.insert(5,"Java"));    // HelloJavaWorld
System.out.println(sb.delete(5,9));         // HelloWorld
System.out.println(sb.reverse());           // dlroWolleH


----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
| Operation           | Syntax                      | Example                   | Output           |
|:-------------------:|:---------------------------:|:-------------------------:|:----------------:|
| Length              | sb.length()                 | sb.length();              | 5                |
| Character at index  | sb.charAt(index)            | sb.charAt(1);             | e                |
| Append              | sb.append(text)             | sb.append("World");       | HelloWorld       |
| Insert              | sb.insert(index,text)       | sb.insert(5,"Java");      | HelloJavaWorld   |
| Delete              | sb.delete(start,end)        | sb.delete(5,9);           | HelloWorld       |
| Reverse             | sb.reverse()                | sb.reverse();             | dlroWolleH       |
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

